       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "AnthonyP"
       },
       "reviewBody": "WORKS SO GOOD!  I had HyperX Beast 16GB 3733mhz in my Omen 30L previously and can tell the difference with 32GB of corsairs ram. Even with it lowering to 3200mhz I didn\u2019t notice any lag or delay in the system launching any game or software. Amazing ram for the price!",
