       }
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "name": "Another great product by Corsair.",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Levon"
       },
       "reviewBody": "I got this because I really needed the jump from 16GBs of Ram to 32GBs. I'm shocked this ram was on sale during the ram shortage the world is going through. This ram plugged right in and was recognized by my motherboard no problem. They may not be pretty RGB but these sticks are super reliable.",
