        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": 5,
        "bestRating": "5"
       },
       "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Best Buy"
       }
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "name": "Good ram",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Kman"
       },
       "reviewBody": "Amazing ram. Good price, low profile stuff so it fit under the cooler i got with the processor. Set xmp profile and it actually set n stayed at xmp settings, no lights or flashy rgb, just good ole ram with decent capacity.",
       "reviewRating": {
